IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Salve, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Oggi mi darò al giardinaggio{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
tutto {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}il {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}giorno! Sai perché?
È il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solstizio d'estate{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}! Avremo
tante ore di luce per dedicarci ai
nostri hobby più cari, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Good evening, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
So have you noticed?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}The sun is up WAY past its bedtime.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I suppose it is the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Summer Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
It's allowed to, just for today.

ES:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Buenas noches, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¿Te has fijado, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}El sol no se ha ido a dormir.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Supongo que al ser el solsticio
de verano se lo puede permitir.

IT:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Buonasera, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Allora, hai per caso notato qualcosa
di strano?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Giusto: il sole splende ancora.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
È il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solstizio d'estate{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}Certe cose
ai miei tempi non succedevano...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}It's evening, right, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
With all these extra hours of
sunlight today, I'm a little lost.
OK, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}pull it together, {{TAG:0005:0001:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}It's night. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Get it right.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ah, feliz solsticio, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
¿Tú te crees que esto es normal?
El sol brillando a estas horas...
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ya sé que es solo un día al año,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
cielín, pero qué ganas tengo de que
acabe, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
